{{!-- First-party page written for Volta (Qompass AI, 2026). --}}
{{#> layout }}
  <h2>{{ text "Usage" }}</h2>

  <h3>Searching</h3>
  <p>
    Use the search box on the <a href="/">front page</a>, or point GnuPG
    at this server:
  </p>
  <pre>gpg --keyserver hkps://volta.qompass.ai --search-keys you@example.org</pre>

  <h3>Publishing</h3>
  <pre>gpg --keyserver hkps://volta.qompass.ai --send-keys &lt;key-id&gt;</pre>
  <p>
    Then verify your addresses from the upload page so the key can be
    found by address and through the Web Key Directory.
  </p>

  <h3>Refreshing</h3>
  <pre>gpg --keyserver hkps://volta.qompass.ai --refresh-keys</pre>
  <p>
    Refresh regularly: revocations and updated expiration dates are only
    visible once your client fetches the current copy of a key.
  </p>
{{/layout}}
